#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""NanoApps: build and install independent apps for nano 7G firmware 1.1.2.

Direct macOS USB transport uses IOKit and diskutil. Local Linux uses sg_raw.
No second computer or SSH dependency is needed. Firmware tools live in firmware/.

  start build [apps...]       compile only (no device writes)
  start package APP           build a standalone, copy-to-iPod app ZIP
  start install [apps...]     merge apps into the on-device catalog
  start firmware build --revision 2012|2015   build, never flash
  start new NAME              scaffold an app
  start run HARNESS           build and execute a one-off SCSI harness
  start deps [--check]        inspect or install build prerequisites
  start peek ADDR [SIZE]      read memory through C6/98
  start trace [COUNT]         read the heap resident's trace ring
  start pull [media|bench]    copy captures from the device
  start remount|eject|fsck    device filesystem operations
  start reboot                restart over C6/98 and verify automatic app loading

With no subcommand, open the interactive menu. --help lists all options.
"""
